# Optional Sentry DSN. Both names are public (the browser bundle includes the DSN).
# Do not store SENTRY_DSN with `wrangler secret put`; a secret and a wrangler
# var of the same name conflict on deploy. The deployed Worker var lives in
# wrangler.jsonc. Set SENTRY_DSN here only to override that value locally.
# Set NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN to override the browser DSN at build time.
# Leave both unset to keep the committed Worker var and its browser fallback.
# SENTRY_DSN=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=
